  "title": "Newell Brands Declares Dividend on Common Stock",
  "summary": "ATLANTA --(BUSINESS WIRE)--May 6, 2026-- Newell Brands Inc. (NASDAQ: NWL) announced today the declaration of a quarterly cash dividend of $0.07 per share. The dividend is payable June 15, 2026 to common stockholders of record at the close of trading on May 29, 2026.",
